### ============================================
### NestJS Solana API Tests
### ============================================

### 1. General Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/

### 2. Solana Network Health Status
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/health

### 3. Check Wallet Balance (From .env TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/{{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}/balance

### 4. Fetch Recent Wallet Transactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/wallet/{{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}/transactions?limit=5

### ============================================
### US-E3 — Transactions Details
### ============================================

### 5. Specific Transaction Detail (Invalid signature - should return 400/404 cleanly)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions/5oG4k6aJ4DYZJq1x5M5eX7d6Y5F2e9b8Z3c1A4f5E6d7

### 6. Advanced Transactions List with Filters and Pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&offset=0&sortBy=timestamp&sortOrder=desc

### 6a. Filter by type (transfer)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&type=transfer

### 6b. Filter by type (instruction)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&type=instruction

### 6c. Sort by amount (ascending)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/transactions?wallet={{$dotenv TEST_WALLET_ADDRESS}}&limit=5&sortBy=amount&sortOrder=asc

### ============================================
### US-E4 — Token Metadata & Holders
### ============================================

### 7. SPL Token Information & Metadata (From .env TEST_TOKEN_MINT)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/{{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN_MINT}}

### 8. Top 20 Holders of SPL Token
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/tokens/{{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN_MINT}}/holders
